      long_en: "Side traps are placed beyond the ends of the line, to the left of stand 1 or to the right of stand 5, and behind protective screens. They throw targets across the front of the line, so from the near end of the line the target is close and fast, and from the far end it is longer and more crossing. Battues and long crossers are often thrown from side traps. Safety rules forbid shooting towards a side trap, so its targets are usually thrown away from the line of fire.",
