      short_uk: "Машинка на вишці чи піднятій платформі, що кидає високі мішені над полем або назустріч стрільцям.",
      long_en: "Many Compak layouts have one trap on a tower, usually a metal or wooden structure several metres high placed in front of, beside or behind the line of stands. Tower traps produce high incomers, dropping targets, high crossers and overhead targets that cannot be thrown from ground level. The height of the tower depends on the ground; it is not the same on every layout. For the organizer, the tower needs a safe access ladder and protection for the trapper.",
