      term: "Layout change",
      aka: ["Change of layout", "Moving to the next layout"],
      cat: "Layout",
      short_en: "Moving a squad to another Compak layout between rounds, according to the competition timetable.",
      short_uk: "Перехід групи на інший майданчик компаку між раундами відповідно до розкладу змагань.",
      long_en: "At bigger competitions a ground has several Compak layouts and each squad shoots its rounds on different layouts, so that everyone meets the same set of targets over the event. The timetable or squad sheet shows which layout and time each squad has for each round. Between rounds the squad collects its scorecard, walks to the next layout and waits until the previous squad has finished. For the organizer, keeping layout changes on time is the key to the whole day running smoothly.",
